Z||000016||rockcrawl||10-15-2001||08:10 PM||||I think you need an enclosed trailer for that car, Haulmark makes some nice ones. I think you also want one that is welded, not bolted together. I also think you need a bigger truck to drag it around.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Designed for automobiles that measure up to 75" outside tire. This trailer is ideal for "wide body" Porsches (911, 944, 993 etc.)<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>The U-Haul trailer I rented to take my Lambo clone to Carlisle was 75". I ended up driving the car to the show because it was 1" too wide to fit on the trailer. <P>p.s. the Fiero with sidepipes made me laugh!||||reg||1
